  "description": "GroupDocs.Redaction for .NET is an easy to use document redaction class library which allows to remove sensitive and classified information from the documents of different formats - DOC/DOCX, XLS/XLSX, PPT/PPTX and others. The library provides powerful sanification features. The sensitive content will be safely removed and resultant document can be saved in original format or rasterized PDF which produces resultant documents which is even more safe to share.",
